{"ID":"20240118151200-sxirwqo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151200-sxirwqo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151200-sxirwqo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151200-o48jgk9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122239-ozsz5ja\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122239-ozsz5ja\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:291,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:291\u0026#125;","title":"153铁精（生铁落）","type":"doc","updated":"20240131102457"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151200-o48jgk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151200-o48jgk9","updated":"20240122122137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】平主明目，化铜铁落，味辛平，主风热，恶创，疡疽创痂，疥气在皮肤中，铁主坚肌耐痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122141-ebvj5dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122141-ebvj5dd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】铁精或铁落为錬铁时锤打所落之皮甲。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122143-abfrtc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122143-abfrtc8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122144-tkhnmtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122144-tkhnmtc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】铁精为解热，安神，补血药，能除风热，治风痉，癫痫，善怒发狂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122146-ihbn81r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122146-ihbn81r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】除胸膈中热气，食不下，止烦，去黑子，可以染皂。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122147-tuu1k1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122147-tuu1k1n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治惊邪癫痫，小儿客忤，消食及冷气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122148-8e81r9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122148-8e81r9i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】炒热投酒中饮，疗贼风痉，裹以熨腋下，疗狐臭有验。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122150-ce0s7p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122150-ce0s7p7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通内服一厘至五厘，煎服者虽数钱亦可，近时多用以融化他药中服之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122151-ep4jqzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122151-ep4jqzd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】铁性重坠，有碍消化，服原质者宜慎之，患肿者服之，一生须忌盐。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122152-8d83mwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122152-8d83mwr"}},{"ID":"20240122122152-fntt4oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122152-fntt4oj","updated":"20240131102331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一百五三，铁精，铁精呢，就是铁落，打铁的师傅，在打的时候，里面的残渣，被打出来那个灰，就是铁落，在《黄帝内经》的时候，有提到，生铁落，是精神病的时候使用，精神，神志不集中，发狂啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122122152-tpnyozg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122152-tpnyozg","updated":"20240131102342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们有一种情形，就是阳明症，大便堵塞不通的时候，人会精神不集中，神志恍惚，如果大小便什么都很好，就是单纯精神病的问题的时候，我们可以使用到生铁落。"}]},{"ID":"20240122122228-3c40p3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122228-3c40p3s","updated":"20240131102401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们拿，应该去那个南部，还有打铁的店，做菜刀的店，或者怎么样的，把那个铁落集合，拿起来，然后龙发堂精神病院，去送给他们，煮起来一锅，给他们喝，你不要来煮，那个让它沉淀下去，生铁落这种东西，慈石，我们用的时候，都是包在棉布里面，棉布包起来，你只有味道出来，但是它的铁质还在袋子里面，可以吃，你煮汤吃没有关系的，又没有毒性的，这个对眼睛非常好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122122231-eibr2je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122231-eibr2je","updated":"20240122122236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按照书上，最主要的我们使用在癫痫，发狂，善怒，容易生气，味道是辛的，且辣，那个铁的味道比较辛辣，你哪天把舌头放在那个铜板，铜币上面，一放就知道了嘛，铁啊，铜啊这种东西，味道都会比较辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240122122239-ozsz5ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122239-ozsz5ja","updated":"20240131102457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是你使用这个的时候，这个药因为它是金石类的，铁类的药，它比较重，当你需要使用到沉重，重剂的时候要注意病人，病人如果说常常有些，下利啊，或者什么，你要小心一点，所谓小心的，并不是说你不能用，而是你使用过去了的时候，你要常常问他，哎你吃了感觉怎么样啊，有没有大便拉稀很多啊，没有就好了。那如果说你是精神的病患，他大便什么都正常，就是精神不正常，你用生铁落，是单味用就可以了，你拿个两钱，一钱两钱，或者是个子比较大，三钱，那就三钱一袋啊，拿去六碗水煮两碗，就直接喝这个就可以了，不需要增加其它的东西，单味的使用，凡是在经方里面的，还有《黄帝内经》里面的用的，效果都非常地迅速，——快。"}]}]}